{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Mutation Test & Harden Assertions",
  "description": "Runs StrykerJS mutation testing on uncommitted source files and instructs qa-test-writer to write assertions that kill all survived mutants.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "userTriggered"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Identify the modified source files in `git diff --name-only` (matching `src/services/**/*.ts` or `src/api/**/*.ts`). Run StrykerJS scoped strictly to those files using `npx stryker run --mutate <comma-separated-files>` so it generates `.kiro/tmp/mutation-report.json`.\n\nOnce finished, adopt `.kiro/agents/qa-test-writer-prompt.md`, inspect all `Survived` mutants in `.kiro/tmp/mutation-report.json`, and strengthen the corresponding `*.test.ts` assertions (without modifying production source code). Re-run Stryker on those files to confirm the mutation score exceeds 85%."
  }
}